      "text": "The non-negotiable: track which specific video drove every single booked call. This is what separates record revenue months from plateaus.\n\n### Production requirements\n\nThe Miro-board-and-screen-recorder setup is not a workaround — it is the feature. For coaches in make-money niches, a produced talking-head video with B-roll signals \"I'm selling you on my lifestyle.\" A Miro board breakdown signals \"I'm showing you the system.\" The second framing is what the trust recession market responds to.\n\nProduction stack:\n- Miro board ($300–$400/month VA builds them)\n- Laptop camera or OBS Studio\n- No villa, no production crew, no editors required at launch"
