      "text": "The caption list is the newest and most considered; Pulsify adopts it as the canonical type menu, with the reconciliation map: educational = breakdown; client result stacking = credibility; lead magnet + timeline-based = CTA (the conversion-frame types); no-idea day = a fallback mode, not a type; story launch and start-here = permanent/campaign assets above the daily types."
