      "text": "**Framework: The follower-to-buyer funnel math (10,000-follower walk-through)**\n\n1. \"let's say you have 10,000 followers.\"\n\n2. Intake:\n\n3. Routing:\n\n4. Why it works:\n\n5. Principle:\n\n**Framework (implicit): The traffic-reel anatomy**\n\nTraffic reels = hook -> cut -> CTA, aimed at strangers; correct for reach, structurally incapable of closing.\n\n**Conversion-asset inventory (named, not detailed here):**\n\nThe conversion side consists of story sequences, lead magnets, and bottom-of-funnel posts."
