      "text": "**The reel-era evolution (his own periodization, from the scroll):**\n\n**The YouTube-era evolution:**\n\n**The three-metric dashboard:** drop-off rate (sequence health), opt-in rate (topic interest + presentation quality), save rate (unexplained).\n\n**Opt-in-driven topic expansion:** high-opt-in lead magnet topic (the brand game plan) -> \"create a universe about that topic.\""
