      "text": "**The five conversion assets (as delivered in this session):**\n\n1. **Story sequences** — the primary one; \"the one that does most of the work.\" Running since.\n\n2. **Lead magnets** — the personalized router: Mechanics: Plus revenue question crossed with problem.\n\n4. **Bottom-of-the-funnel content** —\n\n5. ****\n\n**Story-sequence operating rules (from the Q&A part):**"
