      "text": "Social media is becoming interest media; education sells, entertainment doesn't.\n\nThe platform game is re-sorting by interest/topic, and educational content is the monetizable kind.\n\nThe grandma-slap test: views without pain-relevance never convert.\n\nAsk converted clients which content converted them.\n\nThe market math (his on-screen calculation, verbatim figures):\n\n- Business coaches specifically ( — excluding health/relationship/fitness/dating): \"There are 450,000 people.\"\n\nMost of your current views are structurally worthless.\n\nEven a maximally narrow niche's total pipeline exceeds what any player has ever extracted — niching down cannot run out of market.\n\nMore views should worry you."
