      "text": "- Ladder logic: each format unlocks at a revenue stage; early = buyers over growth, late = reach then harvest.\n- Reach/conversion alternation with deliberate 5x view sacrifice in conversion phases.\n- Boosting: social-based reels amplified with \"very simple retainable ads.\"\n- Distribution tree: long form -> highlights, reels, client results, story sequences."
