      "text": "- Bio anatomy: who-you-help (unboxed) + uniquely-named craft + backtrackable proof + implied next step.\n- The profile conversion chain acknowledged: bio -> reels (organic) ->\n- The follow moment: bio is all a new visitor evaluates — sequencing rationale for why it precedes content quality in the fix order."
