      "text": "**The three steps to shorten the conversion cycle:**\n\n1. Respond in minutes, not hours (emotional-state preservation + small yeses).\n\n2. Never end an open conversation (yes / no / next-steps-with-time — the only three endings).\n\n3. Scarcity by default in offer construction (rotating/limited offers, provably real)."
