      "text": "Reels build the audience; story sequences close them.\n\nStory sequences are built for credibility, not views; consistency is unfakeable.\n\nThe payers are the daily-story watchers, not the reel-stumblers.\n\nThe last-10-posts audit.\n\nThe five story-sequence types (masterclass version), type 1: Q&A.\n\nStories are the safe playing field; reels/feed are not."
