      "text": "Value vs education, defined.\n\nTeach the outcome, not the process.\n\nA confused mind doesn't buy; post the first version.\n\nCredibility stacking imprints inevitability.\n\nThe aesthetic rule: decisions are made on aesthetics before substance.\n\nThe lead magnet sequence de-risks the whole business (own the relationship).\n\nCTA placement is a volume-vs-qualification dial.\n\nHooks: outcome, specificity, speed.\n\nIntention and amplifiers.\n\nThe team as external eyes (why creators plateau).\n\nDrop-off rate is the only story metric; slide position diagnoses the failure.\n\nKnow each asset's single job.\n\nYou pay for speed.\n\nThe funnel is a web, not a line.\n\nMatch the CTA to the viewer's state; kill friction."
