      "text": "Credentials.\n\nIdeate from your sales process, not the algorithm.\n\nThe buyer mirror form.\n\nMine objections from call transcripts with Claude.\n\nChoose funnel-stage content by what the business needs now.\n\nICP vs dream follower: TOF must appeal to both.\n\nShow marketing beats tell marketing 10x.\n\nJudge MOF by attributed booked calls, not views.\n\nBOF = objections solved in creative formats.\n\nWorked example: objection -> (6.6K views, qualified inbound).\n\nThe three-piece testimonial system (sophistication-matched consumption).\n\nThe content team: 7 people, founder-light, 20-30x return.\n\nFollowers don't gate revenue."
