      "text": "**The A-to-Z process:**\n\n1. **Ideation from sales data:** buyer mirror form (why they chose you) + Claude-on-Fathom objection mining (why they didn't).\n\n2. **Stage selection:** diagnose the business need (leads / trust / conversion) from tracked KPIs -> weight TOF/MOF/BOF accordingly.\n\n3. **TOF:** dream-follower/ICP Venn overlap topics; \"onbrand top-funnel videos\" (belief-led, wider than ICP, likability + trust: his money-doesn't-matter-fulfillment-does video — 5,800 likes, 740 shares).\n\n4. **MOF:** show marketing (1-on-1 breakdowns, group-call peeks, transformation breakdowns); measured by attributed booked calls via UTM tracking.\n\n5. **BOF:** objection list -> creative format per objection; three-piece testimonial kit per client (60s / 30min interview / 40min value-front); price increases as urgency+competence signals.\n\n6.\n\n**The ideation-system lead magnet (his product, described):**"
